{
  "uid": "talkcal-app",
  "title": "talkcal — Spring app",
  "tags": ["talkcal", "app"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "app 開始關機（收到 SIGTERM）",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Commencing graceful shutdown\"",
        "target": {
          "refId": "Anno",
          "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Commencing graceful shutdown\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        "titleFormat": "app 開始關機（收到 SIGTERM）",
        "textFormat": "{{container}}"
      },
      {
        "name": "app 關機時還有請求沒做完",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Graceful shutdown aborted\"",
        "target": {
          "refId": "Anno",
          "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Graceful shutdown aborted\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        "titleFormat": "app 關機時還有請求沒做完",
        "textFormat": "{{container}}"
      },
      {
        "name": "app 啟動完成",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "green",
        "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Started Application\"",
        "target": {
          "refId": "Anno",
          "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Started Application\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        "titleFormat": "app 啟動完成",
        "textFormat": "{{container}}"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "請求速率 (req/s)，依狀態碼",
      "description": "sum by (status) rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m])。壓測時看這裡：正常都在 200；一旦冒出 502（llama.cpp 那頭掛/逾時）或 400（送錯），就會多一條線出來。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "auto" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "/api/calendar/assistant 延遲 (p95 / p99)",
      "description": "histogram_quantile 從 http_server_requests_seconds_bucket 算出的長尾延遲。⚠️ 需要 application.properties 的 percentiles-histogram=true，app 重啟後才有 buckets、這個 panel 才有資料。平均會把長尾藏起來，壓測要看的就是這條 p99。圖上的小菱形是 exemplar：某個真實請求的耗時，帶著它的 trace id，滑過去點一下就跳到 Tempo 看那個請求每一段花多久。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=\"/api/calendar/assistant\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=\"/api/calendar/assistant\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "平均延遲，依 endpoint",
      "description": "rate(sum)/rate(count) —— 每個 endpoint 的平均耗時。/api/calendar/assistant 會明顯比別人高（後面掛著 LLM）。這個不必 histogram 就有；要看長尾還是得靠上面的 p95/p99。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum[1m])) / sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JVM Heap 使用量",
      "description": "jvm_memory_used_bytes vs jvm_memory_max_bytes（area=heap）。看記憶體吃多少、離上限多遠。壓測時若已用量一路貼近上限、GC 壓不下來，就是另一種瓶頸（跟 llama.cpp 的排隊是不同層的問題）。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "已用"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "上限"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "資料庫連線池（HikariCP）—— API 變慢時，是不是在排隊等連線",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "連線：借出去的 vs. 上下限",
      "description": "active = 正被請求拿著的連線、idle = 開著但沒人用。max / min 是池的上下限（hikaricp_connections_max / _min，沒設時都是 10），畫成虛線。active 長期貼著 max 代表池太小，或有查詢借了不還（交易開太久）。active + idle = app 這邊實際開著的連線數，要跟下面 PostgreSQL 那張的連線數對得上。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (pool) (hikaricp_connections_active)",
          "legendFormat": "active（借出去）{{pool}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (pool) (hikaricp_connections_idle)",
          "legendFormat": "idle（閒著）{{pool}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "max by (pool) (hikaricp_connections_max)",
          "legendFormat": "max（上限）{{pool}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "max by (pool) (hikaricp_connections_min)",
          "legendFormat": "min（下限）{{pool}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "^max.*" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "^min.*" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dot", "dash": [0, 10] } },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "排隊等連線的請求數（pending）",
      "description": "hikaricp_connections_pending：有幾個執行緒在等池子還連線。平常應該一直是 0；大於 0 就是池不夠用了，等的時間會直接加在 API 延遲上。這是分辨「API 慢是不是卡在資料庫連線」的第一個看點。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (pool) (hikaricp_connections_pending)",
          "legendFormat": "pending {{pool}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "等連線花多久（acquire）",
      "description": "hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds 是 Timer：rate(_sum)/rate(_count) 是平均、_max 是最近一段時間最慢的那次。池夠用時是微秒等級；開始排隊就會跳到毫秒、秒。等超過 connectionTimeout（預設 30 秒）就變成右邊那張的逾時。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (pool) (rate(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_sum[1m])) / sum by (pool) (rate(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "平均 {{pool}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "max by (pool) (hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_max)",
          "legendFormat": "最慢 {{pool}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "一條連線被占用多久（usage）",
      "description": "hikaricp_connections_usage_seconds：從借出到還回的時間，平均和最慢。變長代表查詢變慢，或交易開太久（在交易裡做了慢的事，例如叫模型）。usage 變長、池子大小不變 → 每秒能服務的請求就變少，pending 會跟著上來。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (pool) (rate(hikaricp_connections_usage_seconds_sum[1m])) / sum by (pool) (rate(hikaricp_connections_usage_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "平均 {{pool}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "max by (pool) (hikaricp_connections_usage_seconds_max)",
          "legendFormat": "最慢 {{pool}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "拿不到連線而失敗（timeout，每分鐘）",
      "description": "increase(hikaricp_connections_timeout_total[1m])：等超過 connectionTimeout 還借不到連線、請求直接失敗的次數。只要不是 0 就是使用者看得到的錯誤，該告警。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (pool) (increase(hikaricp_connections_timeout_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "逾時 {{pool}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 60, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PostgreSQL 那一端：各狀態的連線數 vs. max_connections",
      "description": "postgres_exporter（deploy/ 的 postgres-exporter）抓的 pg_stat_activity，依 state 疊起來：active = 正在跑查詢、idle = 連著沒事做（HikariCP 的 idle 連線就在這）、idle in transaction = 開了交易沒在動，長時間不為 0 要查是誰沒關交易。紅色虛線是資料庫的上限 max_connections（預設 100）：所有 app 的池加起來，加上 exporter、你自己的 psql，都要在這條線底下，還要留幾條給管理員（superuser_reserved_connections）。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (state) (pg_stat_activity_count{datname=\"talkcal\", state=~\"active|idle|idle in transaction.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "max(pg_settings_max_connections)",
          "legendFormat": "max_connections"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 40, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "max_connections" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.stacking", "value": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "資料庫連線用掉幾成",
      "description": "所有連到這個 PostgreSQL 的連線數 / max_connections。超過八成就該檢查：是不是某個 app 的池開太大、或連線漏了沒還。pg_up = 0（exporter 連不上資料庫）時這裡會顯示 No data。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 33 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum(pg_stat_activity_count) / max(pg_settings_max_connections)",
          "legendFormat": "用掉"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 0.6 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.8 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "叫模型的保護（斷路器、bulkhead）—— 模型掛了，助理是不是快速失敗",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "模型的熔斷狀態（#44）",
      "description": "GuardedChatModel 的 circuit breaker。綠 = 關著（正常叫模型）；紅 = 打開（模型最近大多失敗或太慢，助理直接回 503 MODEL_UNAVAILABLE，不叫模型）；黃 = 半開（打開 30 秒後放 2 個請求去試，成功就關回來）。門檻和理由在 application.properties 的 talkcal.model.*。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{name=\"chat-model\",state=\"open\"}) * 2 + max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{name=\"chat-model\",state=\"half_open\"})",
          "legendFormat": "熔斷"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "關著（正常）",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "半開（試探中）",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "打開（直接拒絕）",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
